WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.760
- I have always been
amazed with how well Rachel

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:05.163
cries and talks at the
same time in movies.

00:00:05.163 --> 00:00:05.996
(Rachel laughing)

00:00:05.996 --> 00:00:06.829
This is not a joke.

00:00:06.829 --> 00:00:08.070
(audience laughing)

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:08.982
- [Abby] (indistinct)

00:00:08.982 --> 00:00:10.080
- I'm not just saying this right now.

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.750
I, just on this show alone, we have proof,

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:15.210
but I've said it many a times in life.

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:16.043
Here's the tape.

00:00:16.043 --> 00:00:16.876
(wind whooshing)

00:00:16.876 --> 00:00:19.380
I wish I could like Rachel
McAdams cry from the Notebook,

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:20.910
but it's just not in the cards.

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:21.819
- It's not reality.

00:00:21.819 --> 00:00:22.652
(audience laughing)

00:00:22.652 --> 00:00:23.485
It's not.

00:00:23.485 --> 00:00:24.318
- That's not real.

00:00:24.318 --> 00:00:25.151
I just need a minute.

00:00:25.151 --> 00:00:25.984
I'm so sorry. I can't talk when I cry.

00:00:25.984 --> 00:00:27.061
I'm not Rachel McAdams. (sniffling)

00:00:27.061 --> 00:00:29.342
(everyone laughing)

00:00:29.342 --> 00:00:32.200
I can't, I can't.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.150
- [Henry] You look good.

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:34.235
- Yeah.

00:00:34.235 --> 00:00:35.068
- Nothing is dripping.

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:36.330
- Not everyone looks great crying.

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:37.426
- You don't look like Giuliani at all.

00:00:37.426 --> 00:00:39.390
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:41.820
- I also don't look like Rachel
McAdams from The Notebook,

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:42.803
so I'm trying to handle it.

00:00:42.803 --> 00:00:43.636
(audience laughing)

00:00:43.636 --> 00:00:44.619
(wind whooshing)

00:00:44.619 --> 00:00:46.170
- I'm not kidding.
(audience cheering)

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:47.506
I say it all the time.

00:00:47.506 --> 00:00:48.639
- (laughing) Oh my god.

00:00:48.639 --> 00:00:49.560
- Because you know what it is?

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:51.682
I'm angry about it. (laughing)

00:00:51.682 --> 00:00:54.370
Like, I don't understand how you do that.

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:55.203
(Rachel laughing)

00:00:55.203 --> 00:00:57.583
Like, you have this thing where you cry

00:00:57.583 --> 00:01:00.851
and still look beautiful and it's gross.

00:01:00.851 --> 00:01:01.820
(everyone laughing)

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:03.346
It's like what?

00:01:03.346 --> 00:01:04.179
- It's so disgusting.

00:01:04.179 --> 00:01:07.380
- Like your ugly cry is still
unbelievably cute and sexy.

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:08.221
I don't get it.

00:01:08.221 --> 00:01:09.054
(Rachel laughing)

00:01:09.054 --> 00:01:10.110
- What are you, why?

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:11.820
Like how do you do that?

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:13.800
How do you hold your face together?

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:16.322
- I practice

00:01:16.322 --> 00:01:17.670
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:19.020
in front of the mirror.

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:19.853
- Okay.

00:01:19.853 --> 00:01:20.686
- For a really long time.

00:01:20.686 --> 00:01:21.519
- Okay.

00:01:21.519 --> 00:01:24.505
- No, I'm teaching a masterclass in-

00:01:24.505 --> 00:01:25.380
- [Kelly] Crying.

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:26.253
- Pretty crying.

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:28.673
I don't know.

00:01:28.673 --> 00:01:30.267
I don't feel like it is pretty, but-

00:01:30.267 --> 00:01:31.100
- Oh my God.

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:32.505
- And I think you look gorgeous.

00:01:32.505 --> 00:01:33.338
- It's adorable.

00:01:33.338 --> 00:01:34.930
You're lying. And I love you for it.

00:01:34.930 --> 00:01:35.763
(audience laughing)

00:01:35.763 --> 00:01:37.110
It's just one of those things
I was like, oh my gosh,

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:38.880
she comes on here, we
have to talk about this.

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:40.339
It's literally, I say it everywhere.

00:01:40.339 --> 00:01:41.280
- [Rachel] That's so funny.

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:43.560
- Because it's one of those
things I feel like is rare.

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:45.690
Even like the greatest
actors think about movie.

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:47.436
You're like, not everybody
looks great crying.

00:01:47.436 --> 00:01:51.390
- But if you grew up watching
Demi Moore in Ghosts.

00:01:51.390 --> 00:01:52.223
- Oh, I did.

00:01:52.223 --> 00:01:55.770
- You know, that tear where
nothing else is moving

00:01:55.770 --> 00:01:58.050
like the ac-, you know,
that's an actress's like,

00:01:58.050 --> 00:02:00.120
oh, if I could get that to Mecca.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.623
- Don't worry. You're there.

00:02:01.623 --> 00:02:02.602
(audience lightly laughing)

00:02:02.602 --> 00:02:04.633
Yeah. It's upsetting to the rest of us.

00:02:04.633 --> 00:02:05.466
(Rachel laughing)

00:02:05.466 --> 00:02:07.140
It's like, wait, I look like a hot mess.

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:08.940
Like, is she all right?

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:10.923
Like that's how I look, anyway.

